{
 "koral-function": 1,
 "purpose": "Post",
 "description": "A noisy picture \u2014 traced, sampled once a pixel \u2014 smoothed but at its edges: four steps of an \u00e0-trous filter (1, 2, 4 and 8 pixels apart, a B3 spline's weights), each neighbour counting as it is near in `depth` and faces as the same way (`normals`, xyz -1 to 1), and by its colour (`range`, 0 for not). `denoised` is it, RGBA16F.",
 "tags": [
  "denoise",
  "a-trous",
  "atrous",
  "wavelet",
  "svgf",
  "edge stopping",
  "filter",
  "ray tracing"
 ],
